to-be-incorporated-into-paper-137 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: **Codebase keys and the store.** A checked definition is named by its content (PLAN.md revision 7.9, 6 Nov 2026, git 2ca8d747aaa5:PLAN.md, §18.4 “F34 — The store as the codebase: two keys”): its" (cons "key is the SHA-256 of its elaborated type and term with binders nameless, holes solved, every" (cons "checked definition it mentions replaced by that definition's key and every data type by its" (cons "declaration's key, multiplicities kept — not its name, file, position or the machine's build." (cons "Renaming anything changes no key; a changed proof changes its key and its dependents' only" (cons "(`src/store.c`). The store, `CUBICAL_STORE` (default `.cubical-store`; off under" (cons "`CUBICAL_NOCACHE` unless set), keeps under each key `code`, `type`, `usage` and `check`, a line" (cons "per checker that accepted it (the checker named by the hash of the library texts up to" (cons "`chk-def`); a definition whose key the current checker has accepted is not checked again" (cons "(`ok: checks f   [store]`), whatever file or name it comes from, however the machine was rebuilt." (cons "`names` logs each binding of a name to a key. `#key d`, `#names K` (a prefix will do)," (cons "`#history name`, `#unbind name`, `#gc` (entries unreachable from the bound names, through the" (cons "keys their code mentions, are removed)." nil)))))))))))))
